+-; Initial    -> [P0(0), P1(0), P2(0)]
+-;
+-; A(6) goes in 2 -> [P2(6), P0(0), P1(0)]
+-; B(5) goes in 1 -> [P2(6), P1(5), P0(4)]
+-; C(4) goes in 0 -> [P2(6), P1(5), P0(4)]
+-
+-; D(3) goes in 0 -> [P0(7), P2(6), P1(5)]
+-; E(2) goes in 1 -> [P0(7), P1(7), P2(6)]
+-; F(1) goes in 2 -> [P0(7), P1(7), P2(7)]
